      "created_at": "2021-01-28T18:56:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Anyone have the issue where the black paper that has the large flap is tearing away from the cardboard? I'm probably 3 more games from losing the main flap if I don't duct tape a large section of the top of the box, which I don't want to do.</p>\n<p>It seems too regular (it's coming apart in a very clear geometric way) to be a fluke so was checking if this was a common problem and is there a better answer than duct tape</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
