      "created_at": "2021-01-28T19:24:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The same piece was coming apart on mine as wellb and I rarely took mine anywhere due to the weight. I ultimately just tossed the box and transferred things back to the old boxes. Lighter, takes up less space, and i don't have to carry Oblivaeon needlessly around.</p>",
