      "created_at": "2021-01-29T03:19:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was bummed too that the box didn't work out. Granted I wasn't that happy about it once I put everything in. I don't sleeve my cards so there was a lot of empty space. But at least I fit them all in the EE sized boxes, with Oblivaeon and vengeance style villains all in one so I don't have to lug it around unless I really wanted to for some reason.</p>",
